3. Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dan ayat (2) berdasarkan peraturan perundang-undangan dan nilai-nilai kearifan lokal masyarakat setempat.

translated_text:
Article 71

1. Community participation in efforts to protect women and children:a. participates in prevention and provides support for the development of programs to prevent violations of the rights of women and children;
b. provides protection to victims and emergency assistance;
c. provides information from/or reports violations of the rights of women and children to the competent authorities; andd. monitors the law enforcement process for cases of violations of the rights of women and children.
2. Family and Parents are responsible for protecting and preventing violations of the rights of women and children.
3. Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) and paragraph (2) shall be based on laws and regulations and the values of local wisdom of the local community.

text:
